    <section class="lab-section shell" aria-labelledby="lab-purpose">
<div class="lab-label">
<p class="eyebrow">01 · Proof map</p>
</div>
<div class="lab-body">
<h2 id="lab-purpose">Four bounded questions. One evidence standard.</h2>
<div class="lab-method-grid">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">Lab 01 · Evaluate</p>
<strong>Model Regression Gate</strong>
<span>Proven experiment</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">Lab 02 · Diagnose</p>
<strong>Failure Forensics</strong>
<span>Proven experiment</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">Lab 03 · Route</p>
<strong>Cost / Quality Router</strong>
